<title>HONG KONG: Hongkong Bank names non-executive director.</title>
<headline>Hongkong Bank names non-executive director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corp Ltd, a unit of HSBC Holdings, said on Tuesday it had appointed Rosanna Wong Yick-ming as non-executive director.</p>
<p>Wong chairs the Hong Kong Housing Authority and is convenor of the Executive Council as well as executive director of the Hong Kong Federation of Youth Groups.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
